<TalkBubble id="wp_rintro_l02" who="Jordan" face="cheeky" side="secondary">
<Markdown id="wp_rintro_l02_md">Twenty minutes to the ticket, eight hands up, and a pipe story coming. Okay. Let's see y'all do better than her.</Markdown>
</TalkBubble>

